  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></math> be the sum of the first <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math> terms of an arithmetic progression. If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></math>, then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac></math> is :"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math> be first term and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>d</mi></math> be common difference&nbsp;of this A.P.</p><p>Given <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mi>d</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Now <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfenced></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p>"
  }
